*.user
*.suo

# System
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
# Showcase notes: French working notes, deleted once Preview.png and ModIcon.png are done.
PROMPT_*.md

# Claude Code session worktrees and local settings.
.claude/

# Generated DDS copies of the textures. Each has a tracked .png twin in the same folder, which is
# what the game loads, so the .dds add nothing to the source. Forty-three of them sat in Mod/ when
# the 0.1.0 prepublication of 2026-09-23 was uploaded; they never were tracked, and this keeps them
# from ever being committed. They stay on disk locally.
*.dds

# Test evidence lives on disk and is ignored. The record that is versioned is the text summary in
# docs/runs/. What to keep, and how to cut it down, is written in docs/runs/README.md.
# Both spellings on purpose: Windows treats them as one folder, a case-sensitive CI runner does not.
Tests/Pickle/Evidence/
Tests/Pickle/evidence/
Tests/Manual/evidence/
evidence/

# The Pickle suite's step DLL is built from Tests/Pickle/Source before every run and is not part of the
# source: Pickle loads it when the game starts, so a stale one tests the previous code. Rebuild, never
# commit. Its intermediates go to .build/.
Tests/Pickle/Mod/Pickle/Assemblies/
.build/
